This product includes adapted documentation derived from English Wikipedia:

- `.opencode/skills/mgwiki-style/references/manual-of-style.wiki` and
  `.opencode/skills/mgwiki-style/references/words-to-watch.wiki` adapt
  "Wikipedia:Manual of Style" (revision 1381654087) and
  "Wikipedia:Manual of Style/Words to watch" (revision 1382059772),
  consulted 3 November 2026. The source and these adaptations are shared
  under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 license. Each file
  records its own source revision attribution.

The French–Malagasy mathematics glossary in `data/vocabulary/` preserves
source spellings and provenance from the Kajy blog post
"ireo voambolana matematika malagasy" (2011-04-19). It is stored as
translation evidence with attribution and is not dictionary verification.

